; node_output_map.pbi - for each node of the pinned Kokoro-82M graph, in the
; order the ONNX compiler numbers them (the node argument of the progress
; callback), the id of its first output tensor and how many outputs it has.
; Two 32-bit values per node, 2,463 nodes. Taken from the pinned graph.
;
; KokoroSentence.pi4 reads this only in its optional NaN scan
; (#KR_SCAN_INTERMEDIATE_NAN=1), to find which tensors a node wrote. With the
; scan off it is compiled in and never read. It belongs to that one model
; export: a different model numbers its nodes and tensors differently.
#KR_NAN_NODE_COUNT=2463
